Package: permfreeG
Type: Package
Title: Permutation-Free Exact Expectation and Variance for Nearest-Neighbour G Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Alex C.", "Soupir", email = "alex.soupir@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Brandon J.", "Manley", role = "ctb"),
      person("Lauren C.", "Peres", role = "ctb"),
      person("Brooke L.", "Fridley", role = "ctb"),
      person("Julia", "Wrobel", role = "ctb"))
Description: Closed-form analytical expressions for the mean and variance of the
    sample-specific complete spatial randomness (CSR) null distribution of the
    nearest-neighbour G function, for both the univariate (Gest) and bivariate
    cross (Gcross) statistics.  The null model permutes marks among a fixed set of
    spatial locations, giving exact permutation-free CSR curves with optional edge
    corrections, plus a fast 'Rcpp' implementation of the variance calculation and
    an exact-by-simulation permutation fallback.
